      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey... i need help with something kind of weird. i've been noticing this thing at work lately. whenever i get really upset or even just super stressed, the lights in my cubicle start flickering or my monitor will just glitch out. like, it's almost always right when i'm feeling an intense emotion. do u think it's possible that i'm somehow projecting kinetic energy or something through my nervous system? it's getting hard to ignore.",
