      "content": "thanks, i'll look into mindfulness. but i feel like that's just treating the symptoms. it feels more like there's a literal frequency or an aura around me that's reacting to my internal state. like my energy is actually interacting with the physical world. do u think there are any ways to work on my energy field or my aura specifically? i just want to learn how to ground myself so i stop messing with the equipment.",
